<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritius rupee was posted weaker against the dollar and pound on Monday, reflecting low hard currency supply, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean rate of 20.1565 against the dollar from 20.1365 on Friday. Against the pound, the rupee was fixed at a mean rate of 32.9260 from 32.8765 on Friday.</p>
</text>
